      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean_a = 8\n    mean_b = 6\n    variance_a = 4\n    variance_b = 3\n    n_a = 5\n    n_b = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer, following the provided function\n    pooled_variance = (\n        (n_a - 1) * variance_a**2 + (n_b - 1) * variance_b**2\n    ) / (n_a + n_b - 2)\n    t_value = (mean_a - mean_b) / (\n        pooled_variance * (1 / n_a + 1 / n_b)\n    ) ** 0.5\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(t_value, 2)\n```",
